  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 108824494080
    m_Localized: 'This Alpaca is supposed to spit at you, but the Developer was to
      lazy to implement that.

      You can jump on it''s back to squash it though.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8724755460939776
    m_Localized: Follow the arrow. Collect as many coins as posible and try to make
      it to the end.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8726060254388224
    m_Localized: Careful! The zombie can kill you. Approach it from the back and
      jump on it's head.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8729890853511168
    m_Localized: The zombie horde has stolen some coins. Try to get them back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8730726597943296
    m_Localized: Almost there. Try to not get chopped up :)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8731772435062784
    m_Localized: 'This Alpaca is supposed to spit at you, but the Developer was to
      lazy to implement that.

      You can jump on it''s back to squash it though.'
